<!doctype html>
<html lang="id"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="theme-color" content="#07152f"><meta name="description" content="Pusat registri OS MEDIA VM dengan konfigurasi berlapis untuk setiap menu dan submenu."><title>Registri · OS MEDIA VM</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="./registri.css"></head>
<body><main class="registry"><header><a href="../" class="back">← OS MEDIA VM</a><p class="eyebrow">OS MEDIA VM / REGISTRY CORE</p><h1>Registri Sistem & Menu</h1><p>Kelola definisi menu, tampilan, penerapan, dan penyimpanan konfigurasi setiap modul.</p><p><a class="back" href="./antarmuka-lanjutan/">Buka Antarmuka Lanjutan · 25.000 definisi menu/tombol/layout/posisi/ukuran (.txt)</a></p><div class="stats"><strong id="total">1.500</strong><span>menu terdaftar</span><span class="storage-state" id="storageState">Penyimpanan lokal browser</span></div></header>
<section class="controls"><label for="search">Cari menu atau submenu</label><input id="search" type="search" placeholder="Cari registri, konfigurasi, folder, berkas…"><div id="filters" class="filters"><button data-filter="all" aria-pressed="true">Semua</button><button data-filter="dialog">Dialog</button><button data-filter="menu">Menu</button><button data-filter="panel">Panel</button><button data-filter="opsi">Opsi</button><button data-filter="preferensi">Preferensi</button><button data-filter="pengaturan-lanjut">Pengaturan Lanjut</button></div><p id="resultCount" aria-live="polite">Memuat daftar…</p></section>
<section id="menuGrid" class="menu-grid" aria-label="Daftar menu registri"></section>
<div id="modal" class="modal" hidden role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modalTitle"><div class="modal-card"><header class="modal-head"><div><small>OS MEDIA VM · REGISTRY CONFIGURATION</small><h2 id="modalTitle">Konfigurasi menu</h2></div><button id="modalClose" aria-label="Tutup">×</button></header>
<div class="workspace"><iframe id="menuFrame" title="Tampilan menu registri" loading="lazy"></iframe><aside class="config-panel" id="configPanel"><div class="config-intro"><span class="eyebrow">KONFIGURASI BERTINGKAT</span><h3 id="configTitle">Menu</h3><p id="configDescription">Pengaturan khusus untuk menu yang dipilih.</p></div><nav class="config-tabs" aria-label="Lapisan konfigurasi"><button data-tab="layout" aria-pressed="true">Layout</button><button data-tab="pilihan" aria-pressed="false">Pilihan</button><button data-tab="penerapan" aria-pressed="false">Penerapan</button><button data-tab="penyimpanan" aria-pressed="false">Penyimpanan</button><button data-tab="struktur" aria-pressed="false">Folder & File</button><button data-tab="inti" aria-pressed="false">Konfigurasi</button></nav><section id="configFields" class="config-fields"></section><footer class="config-actions"><span id="saveState" role="status">Perubahan belum disimpan</span><button id="saveConfig" type="button">Simpan Konfigurasi</button></footer></aside></div><footer class="modal-footer"><a id="openDirect" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Buka menu di tab baru ↗</a><button id="modalCloseBottom">Tutup</button></footer></div></div>
<script src="./registri.js"></script></main></body></html>